      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ADRENALINE BURST (2) hit the ground running from a squeeze draw and prominent early but run ended and faded to finish 6th at Geelong in Grade 5 company. Comes through a solid form race last start. Can bounce back. AUSSIE WAGYU (6) missed the frame last time when fourth (22.52) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Can figure in the finish. SKETCHY DEMOS (4) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.22) at this track behind Ubiquitous in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Leading player again. STRASBURG (1) form at this distance reads well.",
